3. **`docs/SPEC.md` line 14** says discount rate changes "require a spec update first." The spec was NOT updated to reflect the 15% rate — only the Config section was touched, not the Pricing section.

4. **`DELETE /orders/:id` has no test** — the spec (line 21) says "every endpoint is covered by a test in `test/`." The orders test file has no test for DELETE.

5. **`openapi.yaml` not updated** — the spec mandates "every endpoint is described in `openapi.yaml`." DELETE is missing from openapi.yaml.

